	(gr_text "Stitching Via Spacing Equation\nSpacing in mm = c/20/sqrt(dielectric constant)/(highest freq content on the board) *1e3\n\nin our case:\nSpacing in mm = c/20/sqrt(4.1)/2.4e9 * 1e3\n                = 3.08 mm\n\nfor the dielectric you should use the effective value (air + prepreg); as we are\nrouting the 2.4 GHz signal on the outer layer. but this will do for now"
		(at 124 85 0)
